SHA-256    & 256     & Strong        & Precompile    & $\sim$60--80    & 440 & Partial \\
SHA-3 (NIST) & 256  & Strong        & No            & $\sim$600--800+ & 280 & No  \\
Blake2b    & 256/512 & Strong        & No            & $\sim$600--800+ & 900 & No  \\
